  "instructions": [
    "heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add the onion and cook until translucent.",
    "add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add the lamb mince and cook until browned, breaking it up with a spoon.",
    "add the allspice, cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "add the katsuramuki-cut potatoes and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "form the lamb mixture into patties.",
    "fry the patties in the skillet until cooked through.",
    "serve on a toasted bun with hp-sauce.",
    "garnish with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "serve immediately."
